  title: "How Turkey Became a Car Factory for Europe: From Devrim and Anadol to Hybrid C-HR",
  description: "From 1950s truck assembly and the Devrim experiment to Anadol, Bursa’s export plants and hybrid C-HR, this article traces Turkey’s rise as an automotive hub.",
